  <h1 id="GameFramework_Services_GameDataService" data-uid="GameFramework.Services.GameDataService" class="text-break">
    Class GameDataService
    
  </h1>
  
  <div class="facts text-secondary">
    <dl><dt>Namespace</dt><dd><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.Services.html">GameFramework.Services</a></dd></dl>
    <dl><dt>Assembly</dt><dd>cs.temp.dll.dll</dd></dl>
  </div>
  
  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.GameDataService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="5">Clean GameDataService that manages unified GameSession data
Single source of truth for all game state information
Delegates all save/load operations to SaveService
Uses TimeService for all playtime tracking - no manual time management</p>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

